<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽἀγάομαἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>admirable, wonderful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φυὴν καὶ εἶδος ἀγητὸν Ἕκτορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.370
				</span></i>
			; elsewh. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of persons, c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέμας καὶ εἶδος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.376
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἀγητοί</span>
			<i>wonderful</i> in form only, as a reproach, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.787
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.228
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος ἀγητή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					198
				</span></i>
			: later c. dat. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήμασιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					5.3
				</span></i>
			:—of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόδων ἀ. ἔρνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					53.36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
